Subject: [PATCH] Friends: direct paths through the home router's port mapping
 (NAT-PMP/PCP), and the socket errors games can meet mapped

---
 dm/host/friends_path.c | 44 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 dm/host/hle_net.c      |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 44 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

